SUMMARY:[Center for Teaching and Learning] Course Design Institute 2026
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260904T150000
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-53048204451916-53048267201305@local-events
DESCRIPTION:The Course Design Institute (CDI) is an annual program from th
 e Center for Teaching and Learning (CTL) that provides faculty and lecture
 rs with a collaborative environment in which to design a new course\, or m
 odify an existing course\, optimized for student learning\, inclusion\, an
 d engagement.\n\nCDI participants will apply current research on teaching 
 and learning to the development of a syllabus\, make strategic decisions a
 bout class activities\, and work with colleagues from across Stanford. \n
 \nOpe\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://ctl.stanford.edu/faculty-lecturer
 s/course-curriculum/course-design-institute\nLast synced: 2026-09-04 09:46
  PDT
LOCATION:Lathrop Library
URL:https://ctl.stanford.edu/faculty-lecturers/course-curriculum/course-de
 sign-institute
END:VEVENT
