SUMMARY:[Stanford] Carolyn Lazard: Long Take
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTSTAMP:20260904T164637Z
UID:stanford_campus-localist-52881224936195-52881224967970@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Carolyn Lazard: Long Take is a multimedia exhibition that begi
